{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "RETRYS",
    "steam_appid": 3830610,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h1>\ud83d\udc49Please add it to your wishlist!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830610/extras/02feb6a060f77caa349619044831ebd0.avif?t=1755578576\" width=620 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your support keeps us going! Let\u2019s see it through together until the game is complete!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udff0\u00a0<strong>A little fantasy of laughter and tears \u2014 a story for the grown-up heart.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stage is a bug-ridden \u201cphantom fantasy RPG.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, as the hero, set out on a journey to fix the game\u2019s bugs. <br>But before long, you\u2019ll face the <i>true mystery</i> hidden within this world...</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story for adults where humor, nostalgia, and sadness intertwine.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the simplest gameplay, no battles or grinding. Relax and enjoy the story \u2014 it\u2019s for everyone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A meta world blending virtual and real, past and present, failure and hope.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel art layered with post-effects for a look that is both nostalgic and new.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When this adventure to reclaim an irreplaceable dream comes to an end, you may find yourself wanting to <strong>retry</strong> your own dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>How to Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to complete the game within one week.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to the stories of RPG inhabitants, find the bug-causing \u201cBug Mushi,\u201d and eliminate them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bit by bit, the game will return to its original form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating a Bug Mushi grants you its source program, which can be used to solve other problems by making use of its unique traits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you get stuck, talk to nearby NPCs for helpful hints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcc5 <strong>In Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full version is planned for release in 2026.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please add it to your wishlist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ll keep you updated on development progress as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An English version is planned for the future.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa5 Streaming &amp; Let's Play Guidelines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>free to stream, create Let's Play videos, and share screenshots</strong> of &quot;RETRYS&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both commercial and non-commercial use are allowed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No need for credit or prior permission \u2014 but we\u2019d love to hear from you on X (@retrys_project)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udff0\u00a0<strong>A little fantasy of laughter and tears \u2014 a story for the grown-up heart.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stage is a bug-ridden \u201cphantom fantasy RPG.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, as the hero, set out on a journey to fix the game\u2019s bugs. <br>But before long, you\u2019ll face the <i>true mystery</i> hidden within this world...</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story for adults where humor, nostalgia, and sadness intertwine.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the simplest gameplay, no battles or grinding. Relax and enjoy the story \u2014 it\u2019s for everyone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A meta world blending virtual and real, past and present, failure and hope.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel art layered with post-effects for a look that is both nostalgic and new.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When this adventure to reclaim an irreplaceable dream comes to an end, you may find yourself wanting to <strong>retry</strong> your own dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>How to Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal is to complete the game within one week.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to the stories of RPG inhabitants, find the bug-causing \u201cBug Mushi,\u201d and eliminate them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bit by bit, the game will return to its original form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating a Bug Mushi grants you its source program, which can be used to solve other problems by making use of its unique traits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you get stuck, talk to nearby NPCs for helpful hints.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udcc5 <strong>In Development</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The full version is planned for release in 2026.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please add it to your wishlist!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ll keep you updated on development progress as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An English version is planned for the future.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa5 Streaming &amp; Let's Play Guidelines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>free to stream, create Let's Play videos, and share screenshots</strong> of &quot;RETRYS&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both commercial and non-commercial use are allowed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No need for credit or prior permission \u2014 but we\u2019d love to hear from you on X (@retrys_project)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
